<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan injects 100 bln yen into market.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan injects 100 bln yen into market.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 100 billion yen into the money market on Tuesday, money traders said.</p>
</text>
